[DOCUMENT]
TITLE: SYS-VAL-001 · Acceptance criteria

[GRAMMAR]
IMPORT_FROM_FILE: @requirements

[ACCEPTANCE_CRITERION]
UID: SYS-VAL-001.AC-1
STATEMENT: A calculation request with the operand "abc" is answered with an error response and no result.
VERIF_LEVELS: system
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: SYS-VAL-001

[ACCEPTANCE_CRITERION]
UID: SYS-VAL-001.AC-2
STATEMENT: A division request with the divisor "0" is answered with an error response and no result.
VERIF_LEVELS: system
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: SYS-VAL-001

[ACCEPTANCE_CRITERION]
UID: SYS-VAL-001.AC-3
STATEMENT: After an error response, the next valid calculation request is answered with its correct result.
VERIF_LEVELS: system
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: SYS-VAL-001
